        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "書き間違えた箇所を、ペンケースから出した護謨で丁寧に消した。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3-flash-preview"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "この護謨は消しカスがまとまりやすいので、勉強中も使いやすい。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3-flash-preview"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "角が丸くなった護謨を見ると、一生懸命勉強した証拠だなと思う。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3-flash-preview"
              }
            }
          ],
          "literary": []
        }
      },
      {
        "index": 3,
        "gloss": "condom",
        "register": "standard",
        "nuance": null,
        "scenarios": [],
        "sensory_tags": {
          "colors": [],
          "temperature": null,
